          (∃ (ib : ρ.Eb.A ⟶ ρ'.Eb.A) (_ : ib ≫ ρ'.gb = ρ.gb ≫ i.hom) (_ : ib ≫ ρ'.Eb.f = ρ.Eb.f)
              (uA : ρ'.Ab.A ⟶ ρ.Ab.A) (_ : FakeEllipticCurve.IsPullbackVia (RingHom.id _) ρ.Ab ρ'.Ab uA) (_ : uA ≫ ρ.gA = ρ'.gA)
              (i₁ j₁ : ℕ),
